feat(depth3d): push-pull background inpainting for 3D cover

- InpaintTools: joint bilateral depth smoothing (5x5, luminance-guided)
  + smoothstep fg mask (0.55-0.65 feathered)
- PullPushFiller: pyramid hole filling (mirror pad 8px, O(n))
- DepthCoverPlugin: shared inpaintBackground(); generateDepth now also
  emits bg_fill.png; multi-layer path cuts layer0 from inpainted pixels
- DEPTH_SIZE private -> internal for InpaintTools access

Device-verified: 7 covers generated, bg_fill OK each, ~2.0-2.4s total
(inference-dominated).
