data 698
feat(depth3d): shader occlusion-mismatch fallback to inpainted background

- depth_parallax.frag: third sampler u_bg; when sampled depth is much
  nearer than the screen pixel's own depth (stretched fg side-face),
  resample from inpainted background at 0.35x shift
- DepthShaderCover: optional bgFillPath; degrades to original texture
  when absent (identical() guard against double dispose)
- DepthCoverCache: recordDepth(bgFillPath:) copies bg_fill.png;
  getCachedDepth returns bgFill key, legacy entries stay compatible
- DepthCoverService/Host: pass-through wiring
- tests: cache bg_fill roundtrip + legacy compat; widget graceful
  degradation (runAsync/pump loop for real IO in fake async)
