data 640
Make ResponsiveShell aware of detail fullscreen

Add reporting for detail-panel fullscreen so ResponsiveShell can treat single-column detail pages as secondary. DesktopTwoPane exposes onDetailFullscreenChanged; ResponsiveShell composes central navigator depth + detail-exclusive flag to produce a single "secondary page" result. main layout renames and uses _secondaryPageOnTop and adjusts hideNavigation logic. Also add a small once-per-run greeting pill in DiscoverPage (AnimatedSize + timer + provider listener). Add a temporary Rust probe test (tmp_probe_fileid.rs) and update unit tests to cover new secondary-route/ detail behaviors.
